{
  "description": [
    "How a .vantage.toml resolves its [planning] table: `ok` says whether the whole file is accepted, and `planning` is the resolved table as vantage-md's PlanningConfig (camelCase, defaults applied, `stages` null when absent or empty).",
    "A rejected file is rejected whole: the server logs it and serves the defaults, and vantage-check exits 2.",
    "The rules the cases pin: only roadmap, include, exclude, max-file-bytes, max-candidates and the stages sub-table are keys; include and exclude are lists of strings, and an explicit empty list is kept; both limits are whole numbers of at least 1; each stage maps to open, ready, built or done, and the word is kept exactly as written; the roadmap is a non-empty repo-relative path with a leading ./ dropped, and no leading / and no .. segment.",
    "No case writes an integral float such as 5000.0: TOML calls it a float, Go refuses it for an integer field, and JavaScript cannot tell it from 5000, so the two readers would split on it.",
    "`stages = [\"DESIGN\"]` must be refused, but BurntSushi/toml decodes a TOML array into a Go map without an error and leaves the map empty, so the server has to check the value's type itself.",
    "Read by the server's internal/repoconfig test and by vantage-check's config test."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "no [planning] table",
      "toml": "[check]\nstrict = true\n",
      "ok": true,
      "planning": {
        "roadmap": "roadmap.md",
        "include": [
          "**/*.md"
        ],
        "exclude": [],
        "maxFileBytes": 1048576,
        "maxCandidates": 5000,
        "stages": null
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "an empty [planning] table",
      "toml": "[planning]\n",
      "ok": true,
      "planning": {
        "roadmap": "roadmap.md",
        "include": [
          "**/*.md"
        ],
        "exclude": [],
        "maxFileBytes": 1048576,
        "maxCandidates": 5000,
        "stages": null
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "every key",
      "toml": "[planning]\nroadmap = \"docs/ROADMAP.md\"\ninclude = [\"docs/**\", \"*.md\"]\nexclude = [\"docs/gallery/**\"]\nmax-file-bytes = 2048\nmax-candidates = 12\n\n[planning.stages]\nDESIGN = \"open\"\nDECIDED = \"ready\"\nBUILT = \"built\"\nGRADUATED = \"done\"\n",
      "ok": true,
      "planning": {
        "roadmap": "docs/ROADMAP.md",
        "include": [
          "docs/**",
          "*.md"
        ],
        "exclude": [
          "docs/gallery/**"
        ],
        "maxFileBytes": 2048,
        "maxCandidates": 12,
        "stages": {
          "DESIGN": "open",
          "DECIDED": "ready",
          "BUILT": "built",
          "GRADUATED": "done"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "an empty [planning.stages] table is no stages",
      "toml": "[planning]\nexclude = [\"docs/gallery/**\"]\n\n[planning.stages]\n",
      "ok": true,
      "planning": {
        "roadmap": "roadmap.md",
        "include": [
          "**/*.md"
        ],
        "exclude": [
          "docs/gallery/**"
        ],
        "maxFileBytes": 1048576,
        "maxCandidates": 5000,
        "stages": null
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "this repository's own table",
      "toml": "[planning]\nexclude = [\"docs/gallery/**\", \"frontend/e2e/fixtures/**\"]\n\n[planning.stages]\nSKETCH = \"open\"\nDESIGN = \"open\"\nDECIDED = \"ready\"\nBUILT = \"built\"\nGRADUATED = \"done\"\nSUPERSEDED = \"done\"\nCURRENT = \"done\"\n",
      "ok": true,
      "planning": {
        "roadmap": "roadmap.md",
        "include": [
          "**/*.md"
        ],
        "exclude": [
          "docs/gallery/**",
          "frontend/e2e/fixtures/**"
        ],
        "maxFileBytes": 1048576,
        "maxCandidates": 5000,
        "stages": {
          "SKETCH": "open",
          "DESIGN": "open",
          "DECIDED": "ready",
          "BUILT": "built",
          "GRADUATED": "done",
          "SUPERSEDED": "done",
          "CURRENT": "done"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "an explicitly empty include is kept, not defaulted",
      "toml": "[planning]\ninclude = []\n",
      "ok": true,
      "planning": {
        "roadmap": "roadmap.md",
        "include": [],
        "exclude": [],
        "maxFileBytes": 1048576,
        "maxCandidates": 5000,
        "stages": null
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "stage words are taken as written",
      "toml": "[planning.stages]\nDECIDED = \"ready\"\nDecided = \"open\"\n\"Not decided\" = \"open\"\n",
      "ok": true,
      "planning": {
        "roadmap": "roadmap.md",
        "include": [
          "**/*.md"
        ],
        "exclude": [],
        "maxFileBytes": 1048576,
        "maxCandidates": 5000,
        "stages": {
          "DECIDED": "ready",
          "Decided": "open",
          "Not decided": "open"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a stage word spelled like an object's own machinery is still a word",
      "toml": "[planning.stages]\n\"__proto__\" = \"open\"\nconstructor = \"ready\"\n",
      "ok": true,
      "planning": {
        "roadmap": "roadmap.md",
        "include": [
          "**/*.md"
        ],
        "exclude": [],
        "maxFileBytes": 1048576,
        "maxCandidates": 5000,
        "stages": {
          "__proto__": "open",
          "constructor": "ready"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a leading ./ on the roadmap is dropped",
      "toml": "[planning]\nroadmap = \"./plans/roadmap.md\"\n",
      "ok": true,
      "planning": {
        "roadmap": "plans/roadmap.md",
        "include": [
          "**/*.md"
        ],
        "exclude": [],
        "maxFileBytes": 1048576,
        "maxCandidates": 5000,
        "stages": null
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a limit of one",
      "toml": "[planning]\nmax-file-bytes = 1\nmax-candidates = 1\n",
      "ok": true,
      "planning": {
        "roadmap": "roadmap.md",
        "include": [
          "**/*.md"
        ],
        "exclude": [],
        "maxFileBytes": 1,
        "maxCandidates": 1,
        "stages": null
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "an unknown key",
      "toml": "[planning]\nroadmaps = \"roadmap.md\"\n",
      "ok": false
    },
    {
      "name": "an unknown sub-table",
      "toml": "[planning.roles]\nDESIGN = \"open\"\n",
      "ok": false
    },
    {
      "name": "a role outside the four",
      "toml": "[planning.stages]\nDESIGN = \"open\"\nSHIPPED = \"shipped\"\n",
      "ok": false
    },
    {
      "name": "a role that is not a string",
      "toml": "[planning.stages]\nDESIGN = 1\n",
      "ok": false
    },
    {
      "name": "stages that are not a table",
      "toml": "[planning]\nstages = [\"DESIGN\"]\n",
      "ok": false
    },
    {
      "name": "a limit of zero",
      "toml": "[planning]\nmax-file-bytes = 0\n",
      "ok": false
    },
    {
      "name": "a negative limit",
      "toml": "[planning]\nmax-candidates = -1\n",
      "ok": false
    },
    {
      "name": "a fractional limit",
      "toml": "[planning]\nmax-candidates = 1.5\n",
      "ok": false
    },
    {
      "name": "a limit written as text",
      "toml": "[planning]\nmax-candidates = \"5000\"\n",
      "ok": false
    },
    {
      "name": "include that is not a list",
      "toml": "[planning]\ninclude = \"**/*.md\"\n",
      "ok": false
    },
    {
      "name": "include holding a non-string",
      "toml": "[planning]\ninclude = [\"**/*.md\", 3]\n",
      "ok": false
    },
    {
      "name": "a roadmap that is not a string",
      "toml": "[planning]\nroadmap = 3\n",
      "ok": false
    },
    {
      "name": "an empty roadmap",
      "toml": "[planning]\nroadmap = \"\"\n",
      "ok": false
    },
    {
      "name": "an absolute roadmap",
      "toml": "[planning]\nroadmap = \"/roadmap.md\"\n",
      "ok": false
    },
    {
      "name": "a roadmap outside the repository",
      "toml": "[planning]\nroadmap = \"../roadmap.md\"\n",
      "ok": false
    },
    {
      "name": "a roadmap that climbs out and back",
      "toml": "[planning]\nroadmap = \"docs/../roadmap.md\"\n",
      "ok": false
    },
    {
      "name": "planning that is not a table",
      "toml": "planning = 3\n",
      "ok": false
    },
    {
      "name": "a file that is not TOML",
      "toml": "[planning\nroadmap = \"roadmap.md\"\n",
      "ok": false
    }
  ]
}
